# Google Sheets credentials — set these in Vercel environment variables for production.
# For local dev with `vercel dev`, add them to .env.local (which is gitignored).
#
#   GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_EMAIL  service account with read access to the sheet
#   GOOGLE_PRIVATE_KEY            service account private key (\n-escaped)
#   GOOGLE_SHEET_ID               spreadsheet id from its URL
#   GOOGLE_SHEET_TAB              tab to read (optional, defaults to "Clubs")
#   VITE_USE_LIVE_SHEET           "true" to load from the sheet at runtime; otherwise the
#                                 bundled src/data/clubs.js (generated from the CSV) is used
